Z||000022||80's BOY||07-13-2000||09:17 AM||||am i the only one having doubts about this gullwing door project?? how can you do this with NO DOOR FRAME??? this coming from someone who has done custom doors for other people. i would think the lambo doors would be much more interesting with less cutting/fabrication etc. plus have you ever parked a car with gullwing doors? try getting a spot at the mall. as for the yellow car......<P>SUUUU-WEEEEEEEEEEEET RIDE!!!!!||||reg||5
Z||000023||DaRkLoRD||07-13-2000||02:39 PM||||I think the project would require new doors. or at least extensively modifying the Fiero doors with an upper frame from another vehicle.<P>As for problems parking.. I say the coolness factor would be worth any potential parking-spot-finding problems.. hehe..<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
